      "A new long-term bank loan of £25,915 was introduced in 2022, resulting in a gearing ratio of 20.4%.",
      "Trade debtors increased by 21.2%, while cash reserves decreased by 23.8%, suggesting a slight shift in working capital towards receivables.",
